"Chat with strangers anonymously, with privacy built into the design.\nNo sign-up, no phone number, no email: there is no account to link to you." = "和陌生人匿名聊天，隱私從設計上就被保護。\n不用註冊、不用手機號碼、不用 email，沒有任何帳號能連結到你。";
"Only the two of you can read it" = "只有你們兩個看得到";
"Messages are encrypted on your phone and can only be opened on the other person's phone. Our server only passes along ciphertext it cannot read.\nThe 7 emoji in each chat let you both check that nobody is in the middle." = "訊息在你的手機上加密，只有對方的手機能解開。我們的伺服器只負責轉送它看不懂的密文。\n每次聊天都有 7 個表情符號，讓你們確認沒有人在中間偷看。";
"Nothing is kept" = "什麼都不留下";
"No accounts, no chat history, no trackers, no ad SDKs. When a chat ends its keys are destroyed.\nMessages can burn after reading, the app hides itself in the app switcher, and the other person is told if you take a screenshot." = "沒有帳號、沒有聊天紀錄、沒有追蹤器、沒有廣告 SDK。對話結束，金鑰立刻銷毀。\n訊息可以設定閱後即焚，在多工畫面中會自動遮住，截圖時也會通知對方。";
"Interests, compared in private" = "興趣私下比對";
"The server only sees a coarse group number. Your interests are compared in encrypted form between the two phones, so the other person only learns the ones you share, and nobody ever sees the rest." = "伺服器只看到一個粗略的分組號碼。你們的興趣在兩支手機之間以加密方式比對，對方只會知道你們共同喜歡的那幾項，其他的誰也看不到。";
"Safety without giving up privacy" = "安全，也不犧牲隱私";
"Scam warnings are worked out on your own phone. Reporting someone sends no conversation at all; it just stops them earning trust. Trust tokens are anonymous and can't be traced to you." = "防詐騙提醒在你自己的手機上判斷。檢舉不會傳出任何對話內容，只是讓對方拿不到信譽。信譽 token 是匿名的，追蹤不到你。";
"How to use it" = "怎麼使用";
"1. Pick some interests (optional)\n2. Tap “Find someone”\n3. Chat, and leave or move on whenever you like\n\nNone of this costs you privacy: every pick, match and message stays unknown to the server. It never learns who you are or what you say." = "1. 挑選興趣（選填）\n2. 按「開始配對」\n3. 開始聊天，隨時可以離開或換下一位\n\n這些使用方式都不會影響你的隱私：你的每個選擇、每次配對、每則訊息，伺服器都不會知道。它永遠不知道你是誰、說了什麼。";
